window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Bambi wakes up on Halloween morning, her twenty fifth birthday, in a mighty predicament. That happens when you’re the granddaughter of the Priestess of the Blood Coven. Bambi has less than twenty four hours to complete her Blood Rite so that she can ascend and officially join the Blood Coven.</p> <p>Of course that’s easier said than done. Once she runs into Fang Boucher the entire day becomes so much more complicated. Will Bambi complete the Blood Rite before midnight on All Hallow’s Eve?</p>"; 
